      "key": "descra",
      "label": "Description",
      "searchable": true,
      "value": "Portfolio folder with Brockman logo on cover; interior contains loose paper sheets that include a press release and notifications of items for sale, including David Bradford's Portraits in Black drawings, Dr. Samella Lewis and Ruth Waddy's Black Artists on Art, H. Kofi Bailey's prints, Charles White reproductions, and more. The folder also includes a promotion for the 2nd World Festival of Arts and Culture in Lagos, Nigeria."
